$\mu$ and a slack $\eta_0$) the expected time is $L_N[1/2,(1+\theta)/\sqrt2+o(1)]$, where $\theta=\theta(d,k,\mu,\eta_0)$
is an explicit exponent. For $d=9$ and $k=13$ this is below $1$ ($c\approx0.9972$). The infimum over
